      "divided": "Your answers pull hard both ways on different items: the principle convinces you in the abstract and the practice reasserts itself at the table, and that argument is still live.",
      "lowInformation": "Your average sits close to the midpoint, but the assessment cannot determine whether this reflects a weighted view, domain-by-domain rules, or unresolved tension; treat this reading as provisional."
