    "conceptualGroup": "Ethics and Social Application",
    "reflectionPrompt": "If you learned tomorrow that a species you use products from feels pain roughly as you do, which of your practices would change first, and which would you defend anyway?",
    "methodNote": "Scored from five items using concrete conflict cases. Risk-axis note for reviewers: band language deliberately never prescribes diet, purchases, or livelihood changes and never moralizes the reader's current practice; it describes what each weighting tends to make salient. Both poles carry live blind-spot framing by design."
