      "conditional": "Your design splits by good: perhaps collectivist on health and education, individualist on enterprise and expression. Sectors assigned, deliberately.",
      "divided": "Your answers pull hard both ways on different items: the room and the floor each win outright somewhere, and the blueprint is live.",
      "lowInformation": "Your average sits close to the midpoint, but the assessment cannot determine whether this reflects a both-and design, sector assignments, or an unsettled blueprint; treat this reading as provisional."
