      "conditional": "Your picture splits by trait type: perhaps essential in temperament, constructed in values and roles. Layers assigned, deliberately.",
      "divided": "Your answers pull hard both ways on different items: the recognized core and the visible construction are both compelling, and the account is live.",
      "lowInformation": "Your average sits close to the midpoint, but the assessment cannot determine whether this reflects a layered account, trait sorting, or a live question; treat this reading as provisional."
