    "relatedAxes": "self (who built it, the sibling question), human_nature (the species-scale essence debate), realism (constructed-yet-real as a general category), meaning_practice (what the project is for).",
    "conceptualGroup": "Foundational Questions",
    "reflectionPrompt": "Complete both sentences honestly: \"Whatever else changes, I will still be the one who...\" and \"There is no version of me that must survive; what I keep is...\". Which sentence did you finish faster?",
    "methodNote": "Scored from five items about what the self is, deliberately separate from who authored it. Essential-and-produced and constructed-and-authored are both coherent combinations across the two axes; the pairing is part of the read."
